  "s1": {
   "x": 2720,
   "y": 3720,
   "w": 640,
   "text": "Decisions applied in this prototype\n\nG-3  Observers can be assigned a card for follow-up, but still change nothing\nG-4  Activity logs everything, including description edits\nG-5  Archive a project by typing its name\nG-6  Super admin opens a company as Owner: banner plus logged in Activity\nG-7  Company switcher at the top of the left navigation\nG-8  Sample data: 2 companies, 4 users (Linh, Minh, Hoa, Khoa)\nG-14  Super admin sees company-level figures only; boards and cards only via Open as Owner\nG-15  Projects are archived only, locked after 30 days and kept (G-19), no Delete button\nG-16  Only Owners create projects\nG-17  Description edits log who and when, not the text\nG-18  No CSV export on Usage\nG-20  Company email addresses only; a removed domain locks its people out\nG-21  Inputs checked in the browser and again on the server: 400 for a bad field, 409 for a duplicate or stale edit",
   "fill": "blue",
   "size": "m"
